  "headquarters of the largest Danish bank, with more than 20,000 staff": "sede del mayor banco de Dinamarca, con más de 20.000 empleados",
  "headquarters; an 18-month management trainee programme starting in July": "sede; un programa de management trainee de 18 meses que empieza en julio",
